This code is to be installed on the Daisy Patch Eurorack Module.
It functions similar to an Eventide H-910 Harmonizer and Delay

The controls:
CRTL 1: Delay time
CTRL 2: Feedback
CTRL 3: Dry signal level
CTRL 4: Wet signal level
Encoder: Changes pitch shift ratio (+ or - 1 semitone)
Encoder push: changes back and forth from pitch shifter mode to delay only mode. (default is pitch shift mode)

Each audio channel has its own separate delay line
Audio channels:
IN 1 (left)
IN 2 (right)

OUT 1 (left, pitch shifted)
OUT 2 (right, delay only)

patch notes:
